OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FThe figures have renewed calls for
OL,8,Fgreater protection for some of the
OL,9,Fcountry's most historic and important
OL,10,Fpubs, as ITV News' Rachel Townsend
OL,11,Freports
OL,13,FAdditional reporting by Nations and
OL,14,FRegions News Editor Jade Liversidge
OL,16,FPubs are disappearing across the UK at
OL,17,Fan alarming rate, with hundreds
OL,18,Fclosing their doors this year amid
OL,19,Frising costs and growing pressure on
OL,20,Fthe hospitality industry.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31002
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FFigures from the Campaign for Real Ale
OL,8,F(CAMRA), shared with ITV News, show
OL,9,F794 pubs have closed so far this year.
OL,11,FOf those, 82 have been demolished or
OL,12,Fconverted to other uses, meaning they
OL,13,Fhave disappeared as pubs for good.
OL,15,FThe figures have renewed calls for
OL,16,Fgreater protection for some of the
OL,17,Fcountry's most historic and important
OL,18,Fpubs, with MPs being asked to consider
OL,19,Fnew legislation aimed at giving
OL,20,Fheritage locals greater safeguards.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FThe Heritage Public Houses Bill,
OL,8,Fintroduced by Conservative MP Mike
OL,9,FWood, would require local authorities
OL,10,Fto maintain registers of heritage
OL,11,Fpublic houses and would make provision
OL,12,Frelating to planning applications
OL,13,Finvolving pubs on those registers.
OL,15,FIt would also make provision for the
OL,16,Flisting of heritage public houses and
OL,17,Fother measures relating to heritage
OL,18,Fpubs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FMr Wood represents Kingswinford and
OL,8,FSouth Staffordshire ` the constituency
OL,9,Fwhere the 260-year-old Crooked House
OL,10,Fwas destroyed by fire and later
OL,11,Fdemolished in 2023.
OL,13,FThe pub was known as Britain's
OL,14,F"wonkiest pub", having developed a
OL,15,Fpronounced tilt as a result of mining
OL,16,Fsubsidence.
OL,18,FIt was gutted in a fire in August 2023
OL,19,Fand subsequently demolished, in a move
OL,20,FSouth Staffordshire Council said was
OL,21,Funlawful.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FThe council later ordered the building
OL,8,Fto be rebuilt, while a police
OL,9,Finvestigation into the fire remains
OL,10,Fongoing.
OL,12,FSpeaking outside the site of the
OL,13,FCrooked House, Mr Wood called on MPs
OL,14,Fand ministers to support the new
OL,15,Flegislation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FHe said: "I think the fire and
OL,8,Fdemolition of the Crooked House
OL,9,Fillustrate the gap in the protection
OL,10,Ffor our historic pubs, because whilst
OL,11,Fthe Crooked House was unique in its
OL,12,Fcharacter, its tilt, there are lots of
OL,13,Funique pubs around the country.
OL,15,F"They're all unique for their own
OL,16,Freasons, matter a lot to their local
OL,17,Fcommunities, and I want to make sure
OL,18,Fthat you know what we saw at the
OL,19,FCrooked House doesn't happen at other
OL,20,Fvalued historic pubs."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FThe proposed legislation would not
OL,8,Fcreate a blanket requirement for
OL,9,Fheritage pubs to remain open.
OL,11,FInstead, it would seek to provide
OL,12,Fheritage pubs with additional
OL,13,Fsafeguards and ensure their historic
OL,14,Fimportance is taken into account,
OL,15,Fincluding when planning applications
OL,16,Fare made.
OL,18,FThe proposals come as communities
OL,19,Faround the country are already
OL,20,Fcampaigning to save pubs under threat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31008
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FIn Lincolnshire, the Shipmates
OL,8,FCommunity Group is trying to secure
OL,9,Fthe future of the Ship Inn at Surfleet
OL,10,FSeas End.
OL,12,FThe pub has been closed for more than
OL,13,Fa year, but campaigners have recently
OL,14,Fsecured Asset of Community Value
OL,15,Fstatus.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31009
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FThat designation recognises the
OL,8,Fimportance of the pub to the local
OL,9,Fcommunity and could give campaigners
OL,10,Fgreater influence over its future,
OL,11,Fincluding the possibility of
OL,12,Fattempting to bring it into community
OL,13,Fownership.
OL,15,FMark Newlands, a Ship Inn campaigner,
OL,16,Fsaid: "This gives us an opportunity to
OL,17,Fget the pub on an asset list.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31010
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,F"It means anyone who tries to sell it
OL,8,For wants to buy it and wants to change
OL,9,Fits use, for example from a pub, the
OL,10,Ffact it's on this list has to be
OL,11,Fconsidered because it is an asset of
OL,12,Fcommunity value.
OL,14,F"The list is a good thing for the
OL,15,Fcommunity. It's been around since
OL,16,Faround 1642; there's always been a pub
OL,17,Fhere. Historically there's been
OL,18,Findustry here, and now we have a lot
OL,19,Fof leisure. Walkers, bikers all came
OL,20,Fhere until it was closed 18 months
OL,21,Fago."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31011
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FThere are examples of communities
OL,8,Fsucceeding in their campaigns.
OL,10,FIn south-west London, campaigners have
OL,11,Fhelped defeat plans to demolish The
OL,12,FTrafalgar on High Path in Wimbledon.
OL,14,FThe pub's future had been threatened
OL,15,Fby redevelopment plans, but a local
OL,16,Fcampaign helped secure a victory for
OL,17,Fthose fighting to retain it as a
OL,18,Fcommunity pub.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31012
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,F"It's been here for a long time," said
OL,8,FThe Trafalgar's publican Oli Carter-
OL,9,FEsdale.
OL,11,F"There are people in the community who
OL,12,Fhave known about this place for a long
OL,13,Ftime. Continuity is really important
OL,14,Fto people."
OL,16,F"You need somewhere to socialise, to
OL,17,Fmeet, to unwind, to be able to exist
OL,18,Fin your community," he added.
OL,20,FThe Bill would not prevent pubs from
OL,21,Fclosing altogether.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31013
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FInstead, its supporters say it would
OL,8,Fgive councils more information about
OL,9,Fthe historic importance of pubs when
OL,10,Fdecisions are made about their future.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FBecause for many communities, these
OL,18,Fare more than just buildings with a
OL,19,Fbar inside them - they are landmarks,
OL,20,Fmeeting places and part of the story
OL,21,Fof the places they call home.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31014
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FAnd with hundreds of pubs already
OL,8,Fdisappearing this year, campaigners
OL,9,Fsay the race is on to make sure some
OL,10,Fof Britain's most historic locals
OL,11,Fdon't become part of the past.
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey spoke to ITV
OL,14,FNews from the Chantry Brewery in
OL,15,FRotherham in his constituency to talk
OL,16,Fabout his 20% business rates cut for
OL,17,Fpubs, clubs and venues.
OL,19,FHe accepted the tax cut alone would
OL,20,Fnot be enough to reverse the trend of
OL,21,Fpub closures.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31015
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,FHealey insisted the cut announced
OL,8,Falongside Burnham in the first week of
OL,9,Fthe new government "did give people
OL,10,Fsome hope", but added: "It's not going
OL,11,Fto guarantee their future, but it is
OL,12,Fgoing to give them just a bit of
OL,13,Fbreathing space."
OL,15,FHe said he and the PM "recognise the
OL,16,Fpressure that pubs and other
OL,17,Fbusinesses are on" and have a "desire
OL,18,Fto give businesses some breathing
OL,19,Fspace from the pressures that they
OL,20,Fface".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31016
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786774710
OL,3,CPubs disappear across UK as MPs push
OL,4,Cfor greater protection for heritage
OL,5,Clocals
OL,7,F"We know those are high. We know those
OL,8,Fare tough. We want to relieve the cost
OL,9,Fof business as we can, just as we do
OL,10,Fthe cost of living."
OL,12,FAsked if he could bring in any
OL,13,Fpolicies which reduce the price of a
OL,14,Fpint in the pub, the chancellor said:
OL,15,F"I don't set the price of pints, but I
OL,16,Fcan recognise that where there are
OL,17,Fcost of business, we can do some
OL,18,Fthings to help relieve and where we
OL,19,Fcan, we will."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
